    en_US: {
        "TheCalculater.language": "English",

        "TheCalculater.common.close": "Close",

        "TheCalculater.CrashHandler.title": "TheCalculater Encountered a Problem",
        "TheCalculater.CrashHandler.main_text": "## Oops!  TheCalculater encountered a problem and needs to close.\
\
You can try to restart the program. If the problem persists, please report this issue **follow these steps:**\
\
1. Visit our [Github Issues Page](https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues) to [report this issue](https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues/new). \
   https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues\
2. The crash report has been saved to '%1'. Click \"Open Crash Report\" button below to open it. \
3. **Be sure to attach** the crash report file mentioned above when reporting the issue.\
4. You can also *attach the log file* (click \"Open Log File\" button below to open) to help us solve the problem.\
5. Finally, *describing the steps* you took when encountering the crash will be very helpful to us!\
\
Thanks for your understanding and support! Your feedback helps make TheCalculater more stable and reliable.",
        "TheCalculater.CrashHandler.reportBtn": "Open Crash Report",
        "TheCalculater.CrashHandler.logBtn": "Open Log File",
        "TheCalculater.CrashHandler.restartBtn": "Restart",
    },
