\
1. 访问我们的[Github Issues 页面](https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues)以[报告此问题](https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues/new)。\
   https://github.com/prbegd/TheCalculater/issues\
2. 崩溃报告已经保存至 '%1'。点击下方的“打开崩溃报告”按钮来打开它。\
